      "content": "…; sale, Joseph H. Lang <em>et al.</em>[section 'Order of the University Trustees of the William Rockhill Nelson trust, Kansas City Missouri'], New York (Christie’s), 24 May 1989, no. 402, $20,900, to Dr Simon Hijman Levie (1925-?), Amsterdam;{Loos 1989, p.321.} by whom donated to the museum, with support from his friends, 1989",
